{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lumber_mill","model_identifier":"lumber_mill","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lumber_mill\n\nLumber mill: an open-sided shed over a sawpit (a log on trestles with a two-man pit saw that works up and down), log piles and stacked planks.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 8 columns (160 x 128 units, 4.50 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -76..76, y -2..102, z -42..42 units.\n- Texture: 128 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 30, construction_0 26, construction_33 26, construction_66 33, ruined 13 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- shed: 112 x 104 x 88 centred at the origin (open sides: units may stand under it)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `lumber_mill_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `lumber_mill_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_lumber_mill` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 1.2 | loop | `pitsaw` saws up and down through the log. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_dropoff` at (64, 0, -44)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, -14)\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"post0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.0,0.0,-36.0],"to":[-44.0,72.0,-32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[14.0,0.0,18.0,72.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,22.0,72.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14.0,0.0,18.0,72.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,22.0,72.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[52.0,450.0,56.0,454.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[52.0,450.0,56.0,454.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"77c80baa-d2b8-5275-ac26-642c3af3ab0f"},{"name":"post1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0.0,0.0,-36.0],"to":[4.0,72.0,-32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[22.0,0.0,26.0,72.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,22.0,72.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22.0,0.0,26.0,72.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,22.0,72.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[56.0,450.0,60.0,454.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[56.0,450.0,60.0,454.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a83a553b-a271-500e-a3b5-7430b73a83ef"},{"name":"post2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[44.0,0.0,-36.0],"to":[48.0,72.0,-32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,30.0,72.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,22.0,72.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,30.0,72.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18.0,0.0,22.0,72.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[60.0,450.0,64.0,454.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[60.0,450.0,64.0,454.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube"