n":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["11163eec-4af3-5fa9-ab8f-6aba7424f3f8","e034c12b-2727-55c8-a2dc-1a2f9aa5f9ea","7dce762e-5609-5bfd-a3c2-d0864b345cc0","8376f7dd-44d8-5384-adbf-bd70fe50386c","5b54adb8-cb92-50b0-a932-15b21c23db0e","92dd06cc-469b-526b-9e18-5e501cd6524d","828bd354-5d74-513a-b294-22cdf20ee26b","32ad1511-8cd8-506d-b3c4-6bd8ac67aa66","0472f9ef-e4b2-50b9-acca-ee62ae7ec84b","402bd682-cf41-5089-ae9e-538184352c98","0eb703b9-8d7d-51d4-86ee-d921484ae349","d64f87f9-2efa-541c-ade0-598e95921231","79903485-f706-5809-b670-b79f7c825249"]},{"name":"slot_dropoff","origin":[64.0,0.0,-44.0],"color":0,"uuid":"f693474f-9139-5f59-83a4-a0a5a79806ae","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]},{"name":"slot_work","origin":[0.0,0.0,-14.0],"color":0,"uuid":"2a0a99e0-4ec8-5557-a683-6d35b72536a0","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"lumber_mill.png","name":"lumber_mill.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":128,"height":512,"uv_width":128,"uv_height":512,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"a8fb2323-b192-59fa-b966-3457d77b7117","relative_path":"lumber_mill.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[{"uuid":"8b616e08-8749-579e-9fa7-9acc8919c7d1","name":"working","loop":"loop","override":false,"length":1.2,"snapping":24,"selected":false,"anim_time_update":"","blend_weight":"","start_delay":"","loop_delay":"","animators":{"2fed99c5-0509-5ca7-b0a6-3202644b8625":{"name":"pitsaw","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"3f43c995-7426-55b3-93b1-a189f10d20f9","time":0.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":-10.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"a138fa0e-d5c0-5873-bf84-9c19f2323f47","time":0.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"4206931a-eb82-5bbe-beb5-9ab8dbbb0b85","time":1.2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# lumber_mill\n\nLumber mill: an open-sided shed over a sawpit (a log on trestles with a two-man pit saw that works up and down), log piles and stacked planks.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 8 columns (160 x 128 units, 4.50 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -76..76, y -2..102, z -42..42 units.\n- Texture: 128 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 30, construction_0 26, construction_33 26, construction_66 33, ruined 13 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- shed: 112 x 104 x 88 centred at the origin (open sides: units may stand under it)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `lumber_mill_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `lumber_mill_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_lumber_mill` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 1.2 | loop | `pitsaw` saws up and down through the log. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_dropoff` at (64, 0, -44)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, -14)\n"}